’s global conferences, workshops, and live webinars. Join our local chapters to network in person and develop deep connections with other management accountants. Explore our networking events Our thought leadership shapes the industry Explore our publications Digital publications Read the latest trends in our award-winning Strategic Finance Magazine and more. Read articles Research We fund thought-provoking research through grants to academics and doctoral students. Learn about our research Podcast The Count Me In podcast features talks with industry experts and thought leaders. Listen now Joining the IMA community is an investment in your future Become a member and build relationships, enrich your career, and prepare yourself for the future. Start your membership today Build your community “IMA has been my professional family, and it’s really helped me develop into the leader that I am.” Virginia D. White, CMA, CSCA Corporate Purchasing Finance Director, Cummins Want to learn more about IMA? Our valuable courses and certifications help you stay ahead with the latest trends, research, and best practices in management accounting. Email us at [email protected] Call us at (800) 638-4427 Company About IMA IMA Leadership Our Certifications Press Releases Ethics Center Careers at IMA Support Donate Knowledge Center Chapter Leader Portal Volunteering with IMA Sponsorships Contact Us Privacy Policy Terms & Conditions Cookie Policy © 1997-2026 Institute of Management Accountants. All Rights Reserved.",
